        <mxCell id="a7_body"
                value="&lt;b&gt;Inputs (real-time)&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· API error rates, latency, traffic&#xa;· Deployment record + SHA&#xa;· SLA / SLO thresholds&#xa;· Historical anomaly patterns&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Actions&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Streams telemetry from InfluxDB&#xa;· Runs STL + Z-score anomaly detection&#xa;· Runs Isolation Forest (multivariate)&#xa;· Detects sustained &amp; flash anomalies&#xa;· Computes blast radius (affected apps)&#xa;· Triggers cascade risk predictions&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Outputs&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Anomaly events with severity&#xa;· Blast radius report&#xa;· Correlation signal to predictive agent&#xa;· Incident context packet&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Live Stress Testing&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Continuously replays realistic load&#xa;  patterns from production traffic&#xa;· Identifies APIs approaching limits&#xa;· Generates live failure scenarios&#xa;  for the fix agent to pre-build against"
