                value="&lt;b&gt;Inputs&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Live anomaly events from ⑦&#xa;· AR(1) forecast signals&#xa;· Behavioral cross-correlations&#xa;· Historical co-failure patterns&#xa;· Prior agent context (planning,&#xa;  build, test, deploy records)&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Actions&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Projects failure 1–4 hours ahead&#xa;  using AR(1) on STL residuals&#xa;· Computes cascade risk scores&#xa;  (behavioral cross-correlation)&#xa;· Ranks at-risk APIs by blast radius&#xa;· Determines root cause hypothesis&#xa;· Queries prior build/deploy context&#xa;  to identify likely change vectors&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Outputs&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Time-to-failure estimate per API&#xa;· Cascade risk ranking&#xa;· Root cause hypothesis packet&#xa;· Fix brief to proactive fix agent&#xa;· Confidence-weighted priority list"
