        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a9_body"
                value="&lt;b&gt;Inputs&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Fix brief from predictive agent&#xa;· Codebase snapshot (from build agent)&#xa;· Prior test results + coverage&#xa;· Deployment config &amp; runbooks&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Actions&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Generates targeted code fix&#xa;  before the issue materialises&#xa;· Writes tests for the fix scenario&#xa;· Stages fix in a shadow environment&#xa;· Runs validation against live-stress&#xa;  patterns from monitoring agent&#xa;· Produces full diff + rollout plan&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Context Leveraged from Prior Agents&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· ① Planning: original intent + risks&#xa;· ② Build: last known-good code path&#xa;· ③ Review: security constraints&#xa;· ④ Testing: coverage gaps to patch&#xa;· ⑤ Validation: SLA thresholds&#xa;· ⑥ Deploy: current canary state&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Outputs&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Staged fix PR (ready to deploy)&#xa;· Shadow test results&#xa;· Deploy recommendation + timing"
                style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;
                       verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#CBD5E1;
                       spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=10;"
                vertex="1" parent="1">
