        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="a10_body"
                value="&lt;b&gt;Inputs&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Staged fix from agent ⑨&#xa;· Deploy recommendation&#xa;· Confidence threshold config&#xa;· Human approval signal (optional)&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Decision Gate&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· If confidence ≥ threshold AND&#xa;  routine fix (e.g. credential&#xa;  rotation, config revert):&#xa;  → Auto-deploy without human&#xa;· If novel fix OR high blast radius:&#xa;  → Escalate with full brief&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Actions&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Rolling deploy with traffic shift&#xa;· Live health check polling&#xa;· Error rate validation post-deploy&#xa;· Auto-rollback if rate rises&#xa;· Stamps fix with issue SHA&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Outputs&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;· Deployment record&#xa;· Issue → fix audit trail&#xa;· Signals monitoring agent to&#xa;  resume baseline tracking&#xa;· Updates context store with&#xa;  new known-good state"
